{"id":"468d35690d25ee42","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-robinson-arithmetic.md","title":"Robinson Arithmetic","display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","aliases":["92-df-robinson-arithmetic"],"display":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 68–71（PDF 85–88）","source_status":"原书内容与本地呈现已分开"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-robinson-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 68–71（PDF 85–88）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容与本地呈现已分开"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-robinson-arithmetic-—-Robinson-Arithmetic-$Q$\">df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\cdot,=\">\\(0,S,+,\\cdot,=\\)</span> (arithmetic symbols of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (definition-target Robinson-arithmetic axiom set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash Q\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\\forall x\\;(S(x)\\neq0),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(S(x)=S(y)\\to x=y),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\to\\exists y\\;(x=S(y))),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x+S(y)=S(x+y)),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x\\cdot0=0),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\\end{array}\\right\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash Q\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\\forall x\\;(S(x)\\neq0),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(S(x)=S(y)\\to x=y),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\to\\exists y\\;(x=S(y))),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x+S(y)=S(x+y)),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x\\cdot0=0),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\\end{array}\\right\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>：Robinson 算术</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>包含后继、加法和乘法的七条基本公理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>不含归纳模式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>是常用的弱算术基理论</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里是本地七公理 Q。原书 (Q) 是保留原始 ≤ 的九公理变体，由 P.A. 删除归纳模式得到；原书另有五模式的 (R)。不能把七公理集合逐字归因为书中九条 N₁–N₉。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 68–69（PDF 85–86）。</p>\n<p>原书的九公理 Q 及八公理 Q₀ 已独立写为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ee662ea7161b3d7\" href=\"?note=8ee662ea7161b3d7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems\">92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</a>；在原书中 R₀→Q₀ 的 subsystem 关系是定理包含，由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9548f0941b8c15ce\" href=\"?note=9548f0941b8c15ce\" title=\"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction\">92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction</a> 的逐数码有限证明支撑，不是无限公理集的字面包含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-robinson-arithmetic-—-Robinson-Arithmetic-$Q$","text":"df-robinson-arithmetic — Robinson Arithmetic $Q$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$0,S,+,\\cdot,=$ (arithmetic symbols of $\\Sigma_G$, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems","status":"resolved","id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书的九公理 Q 及八公理 Q₀ 已独立写为 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]；在原书中 R₀→Q₀ 的 subsystem 关系是定理包含，由 [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] 的逐数码有限证明支撑，不是无限公理集的字面包含。","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"9548f0941b8c15ce","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"原书的九公理 Q 及八公理 Q₀ 已独立写为 [[92-df-smullyan-weak-systems]]；在原书中 R₀→Q₀ 的 subsystem 关系是定理包含，由 [[92-lem-smullyan-numeral-reduction]] 的逐数码有限证明支撑，不是无限公理集的字面包含。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"0,S,+,\\cdot,=","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}robinson\\text{-}arithmetic} \\vdash Q\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}\\forall x\\;(S(x)\\neq0),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(S(x)=S(y)\\to x=y),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x\\neq0\\to\\exists y\\;(x=S(y))),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x+0=x),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x+S(y)=S(x+y)),\\\\ \\forall x\\;(x\\cdot0=0),\\\\ \\forall x\\,\\forall y\\;(x\\cdot S(y)=x\\cdot y+x)\\end{array}\\right\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":1757,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28281ca315fc78c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c1547d2395ecc99c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7c3e3d72ee35c3e0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里保留原书的开放公式 $\\Omega_4,\\Omega_5$；它们的全称闭包通过 Gen 导出。原书九条公理 Q 不能与 [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]] 的本地七公理集合逐字等同。也不能直接代入限定于 $\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ 的系统性质。"},{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]])"},{"id":"8086f2be7f666ab6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"82fce7dbd28f0125","anchor":"ref-12",